[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回到会客厅一看，<br>可可留在这里还没走。|#0102Adv21_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她坐在沙发上，脸埋在双膝间，<br>肩膀不住地发抖。|#0102Adv21_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（可可一定受到了相当大的打击吧……）|#0102Adv21_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在犹豫要不要上前打招呼。|#0102Adv21_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（稍微调查一下就赶紧走吧……）|#0102Adv21_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她蹑手蹑脚地走了进来，<br>努力不发出任何声音，<br>但可可注意到了她。|#0102Adv21_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，原来是你啊艾玛亲。<br>你在搜查？查来查去有什么意义吗？|#0102Adv21_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:什么意义……因为不调查的话<br>就不知道杀害米莉亚的凶手是谁啊。|#0102Adv21_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是谁都无所谓吧。<br>她被杀也是理所当然的。|#0102Adv21_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:说得也太过分了……！|#0102Adv21_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可狠狠瞪了眼艾玛。|#0102Adv21_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:谁让她背叛了我们！<br>被杀也是活该！|#0102Adv21_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（可可在逞强……）|#0102Adv21_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她大概是无法接受米莉亚的死亡，<br>甚至没力气离开这里吧。|#0102Adv21_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛找不到话反驳她，<br>只能悲伤地看向她。|#0102Adv21_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:对了，这个给你。|#0102Adv21_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可冷不防地把一团皱皱巴巴的纸递给艾玛。|#0102Adv21_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是什么……？）|#0102Adv21_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

