; ☆証拠品：『拷問ショーの案内』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:2-1
@UpdateWitchBook Id:2-1 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:"她摊开纸团，<br>上面有一行潦草的字迹，写着<br>【20时 在惩罚室举行拷问秀】。|#0102Adv21_Narrative009|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……！|#0102Adv21_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天晚上我看到有便条贴在这边墙上，<br>就把它给撕下来了。|#0102Adv21_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会不会是运营方写的。<br>真恶心。|#0102Adv21_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，典狱长好像讲过<br>　【杀鸡儆猴】什么的……）|#0102Adv21_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（难道说，这是杀害米莉亚的<br>　预告信……？）|#0102Adv21_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛低头看着纸上潦草的字，<br>吞了吞口水。|#0102Adv21_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，你当时发现这张纸的时候……|#0102Adv21_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在不行。抱歉，我不想跟任何人说话。|#0102Adv21_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Coco Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可又一次把脸埋在双膝间。|#0102Adv21_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……审判我会好好参加的。<br>到那时我会，怎么说呢……|#0102Adv21_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我会回到平常那样。|#0102Adv21_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯，对不起。|#0102Adv21_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在就让她一个人静静吧）|#0102Adv21_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛快步走出了会客厅。|#0102Adv21_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

